      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ONE LAST RESORT (3) is the top pick after resuming with a second at Northam, beaten a long neck by Blue Destiny in a Mdn. This is tougher, but he laid the foundations last start and now gets Pike on board. Can go one better with the fresh run under his belt. OFFICIAL BUSINESS (1) is the main danger, having won his past two, including last start at Ascot despite covering ground. This looks to shape similarly and he can bring up the hat-trick. SUPERSMASH (6) has not been far away in stronger Saturday company after winning in this grade three starts ago. LI's 3kg claim comes in handy and a return to this level can see her find her best form. CHIXFROMTHESTIX (7) was well held in the Listed Max Simmonds Stakes, yet she is back to a more suitable assignment. Expecting a better performance. FAST BREAK (5) trialled nicely coming in and can't be discounted.",
